{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"OBA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"俄巴底亚书","commonName":"俄巴底亚书","title":"俄巴底亚书","order":31,"numberOfChapters":1,"sha256":"c10c2281940a3bd0006f737fd06cfcb5264536985c5a57cfc02605389c7b7b75","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/OBA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":1,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/OBA/1.json","totalNumberOfVerses":21},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以下是俄巴底亚看到的异象。",{"lineBreak":true},{"lineBreak":true},"耶和华惩罚以东",{"text":"我们从耶和华那里听到消息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有位使者被派去对列国说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“起来，我们去攻打以东吧！”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"关于以东，主耶和华说：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“看啊，我要使你在列国中最弱小，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"备受藐视。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你住在岩穴中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"居住在高山上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自以为谁也不能把你拉下来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你的骄傲欺骗了你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使你如鹰高飞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在星辰间搭窝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也必把你拉下来。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"“盗贼夜间来你家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道不只偷所需要的吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人们到你那里摘葡萄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道不留下几串吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你会被彻底毁灭！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以扫","poem":1},{"noteId":0},{"text":"要被洗劫一空，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他藏的珍宝要被搜去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的盟友将你逐出家园；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的朋友欺骗你，战胜你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的知己设陷阱害你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你却懵然不知。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：“到那天，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要毁灭以东的智者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除掉以扫山上的明哲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"提幔的勇士必惊慌失措，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以扫山上的人尽遭杀戮。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["惩罚以东的原因"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"“因你曾残暴地对待同胞兄弟雅各，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必蒙羞，永遭毁灭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"当外人掠夺雅各的财物、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"异族攻入耶路撒冷的城门抽签分赃时，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你竟然袖手旁观，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像他们的同伙一样。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的亲族遭难之日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不该幸灾乐祸；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"犹大人被灭的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不该兴高采烈；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们遭难的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不该口出狂言；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我子民遭难的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不该闯进他们的城；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们遭难的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不该幸灾乐祸；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们遭难的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不该趁火打劫；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不该站在路口截杀那些逃亡者；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们遭难的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不该把幸存者交给仇敌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"“耶和华惩罚万国的日子近了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必按你的所作所为报应你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的恶行必落到自己头上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"犹大人在我的圣山上怎样饱饮愤怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万国也要照样不停地喝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"且要大口吞下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到他们完全消逝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列的复兴"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"“然而，锡安山必成为避难所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成为圣地。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各家必得到自己的产业。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各家将成为火，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"约瑟家将成为烈焰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以扫家将成为碎秸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被火焚烧、吞噬，无一人逃脱。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"“南地的人将占领以扫山；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"丘陵的人将占领非利士，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"夺取以法莲和撒玛利亚；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"便雅悯人将占领基列。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被掳的以色列人将占领迦南人的土地，远至撒勒法；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从耶路撒冷被掳到西法拉的人将占领南地各城。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拯救者必登上锡安山，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"统治以扫山，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华必做王掌权。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"“以扫”又名“以东”。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":6}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/OBA/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JON/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/9.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}